---
description: Slash commands /run /fix /stop for local API, admin-web, and Expo Metro
alwaysApply: true
---

When the user types `/run`, `/fix`, or `/stop`, follow `.cursor/skills/dev-stack/SKILL.md` immediately.

- `/run` and `/fix`: start missing API / admin / Metro as **three background Shells** (`block_until_ms: 0`). Do not rely on `stack.sh run` alone — those children die when the command ends.
- `/stop`: `bash .cursor/skills/dev-stack/scripts/stack.sh stop`
- Health: `bash .cursor/skills/dev-stack/scripts/stack.sh status`
- Do not ask first.
